==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF6600|'''Get a First-Time Draw Discount, starting from February 15th (11:00am).'''}}<br>
Your first Rare Capsule draw made after the time above will be available for all players at a big Cat Food cost discount!<br>
Your first single draw will be available for only {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food), and your first 11-Capsule Draw will cost only {{Color|#FF0000|'''750 Cat Food'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food)!<br>
Get awesome heroes at a special low cost!<br>
※ The single-draw and 11-draw discounts are only available for one try when the notice is displayed.

==Explanation==
During this [[Special Events|Special Event]], the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] will only cost 30 [[Cat Food]] for 1 Try and 750 [[Cat Food]] for 11 Tries rather than 150 and 1,500 [[Cat Food]] respectively. The discounts will stay until used '''once''', and they '''cannot''' be stacked. After being used, the draws will revert back to their normal cost value. All players receive this discount once by default after joining the game.

